                    "message": "when I use the command like this for FW update\ncurl -k  https://root:0penBmc@${BMC_IP}/redfish/v1/UpdateService/update-multipart --form \"UpdateFile=@./pldm_bundle.fwpkg;type=application/octet-stream\" --form 'UpdateParameters={}' --form 'UpdateParameters={\"ForceUpdate\":true}' it starts using HTTP version 2 by default. is there a way I can switch to use HTTP version 1 by default like meson option"
